%% TECH-003 Pipeline and branch protection
%% From a pull request to the live site, with main protected.
flowchart TD
    A[Branch protection on main] -->|R1, R2| B[Pull request from the branch]
    B --> C[CI: check, security]
    B --> D[Vercel builds the preview on muppbarnen-preview]
    D -->|R4| E[Preview tests: preview]
    C --> F{All four checks green and branch up to date?}
    E --> F
    D --> F
    F -->|yes| G[Merge to main]
    G --> H[Vercel deploys production]
    H -->|R3| I[Live tests against production]
